      "experiences": [
        {
          "companyId": "321997",
          "companyUrn": "urn:li:fsd_company:321997",
          "companyLink1": "https://www.linkedin.com/company/martha%27s-vineyard/",
          "title": "Producer",
          "subtitle": "Martha's Vineyard . Contract",
          "caption": "Aug 2010 - Present · 15 yrs 5 mos",
          "metadata": "Vineyard Haven, Massachusetts, United States",
          "breakdown": false,
          "subComponents": [
            {
              "description": {
                "type": "textComponent",
                "text": "When I first started to draft this commemoration, it started off as a list with credits like, \"two Seasons of live Broadcasting Bill Murray's baseball team\" this, and \"trusted personal relationship with Oscar-winner\" that; \"alone in my private broadcast booth with superstar\" this, and \"sincerely unsolicitedly complimented by the leader of the free World\" that, but when attempting to compile a comprehensive recollection of the past decade, Tracy, and I simply could not.  There are just too many special moments, and singular experiences You  to recount.\nIt's been an absolutely thrilling ride, I must say, as reviewing a memory box full of mementos on this occasion brought back rushes of so many golden days, and nights.  We are very lucky to live where we do, and are so grateful for the gracious experience we have been afforded.\nOur success with the MVPBS social media promotion, and exclusive films project could only have happened on Martha's Vineyard.\nI guess I'm most proud of eight straight Seasons as Official Videographer for the MVRHS Football Team, and earning the trust of the key figures of this place to give me the responsibility of being let into the most exclusive companies on earth.\nMore than anything what I have had retaught to me the most over, and over again is that I'm actually the funniest person on the planet, but I am so glad, so glad, that I chose family over fame.\nOur best times always never include recording devices of any kind except for our sweet memories, and for that I am eternally thankful."
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Official Videographer/Executive Producer",
          "subtitle": "Martha's Vineyard NCAA Showdown . undefined",
          "caption": "Jan 2016 - Present · 10 yrs",
          "metadata": "Martha's Vineyard Arena",
